# Scratch build output - never committed.
#
# WARNING: directories named "build/" are ALSO excluded from workspace
# snapshots, so anything written there is silently discarded and never
# reaches the user. Deliverables must go in apk/, which is committed.
build/
*.idsig

# Signing keys are never committed.
*.p12
*.jks
*.keystore

# APK deliverables under apk/ ARE committed and pushed to GitHub.
# See apk/README.md.
